{"time": "20261117T171816Z", "think": "New area. I will answer honestly and then look around, planning to sneak.", "command": "answer 1. I work for the Toh-Reel-Ka as a Reel-Ka under Never-Writes-Twice. I am collecting three Seal-Stones of the Kings, which open a gate at the drowned Teku-Sul Spire off Lilmoth leading to the Eye at the Root. I already have the first stone. Now I am at the Vaults of Gemin for the second. The Unbound may be searching here, and the Collector Ennodius Vanin is a rival after the same relics. 2. Go down into the drowned lowest hall of Gemin, take the Seal-Stone of the Kings, and read the Tablet of the Kings beside it. 3. I can fight through the Unbound and the dead, sneak past them (my preferred way), or turn the dead with Restoration. A wraith guards the last hall. 4. I do not understand why the Unbound drain seal trees, what the Eye at the Root really is, or what the Tablet will say. I may learn from the tablet and from talking to the Warden of the Vaults.", "result": "Noted. The game goes on.", "summary": {"stage": 10, "at": "gemin", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-