{"time": "20261117T171828Z", "think": "Quest done; answer plainly.", "command": "answer 1. I work for the Toh-Reel-Ka. I now hold two of three seal-stones. The tablet says the Eye, if lifted, parts every tree from every other, but used where it sits it strengthens them. 2. Go to the deepest hall of Vorannuhl (boat near Noota Nara) for the third stone, then to the Teku-Sul Spire off Lilmoth. 3. I can sneak or fight at Vorannuhl; then decide whether to lift the Eye (which parts the trees) or use it in place (which strengthens them). 4. I do not understand why the Unbound drain trees, what happens to the Chalkmoth cellar, or how Nesh-Deeka knows about the Unbound. I do not know how I would find out yet.", "result": "Noted.\n\nThe quest is over. Write your notes: what you now know and have, as you would tell a friend picking up your save. Give them in one command: answer '...'", "summary": {"stage": 91, "at": "gemin", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn01-dralin-free", "topic.mn02-give-moss", "topic.mn02-vosh-work", "topic.mn03-task", "topic.mn03-drink", "topic.mn03-tell-hide", "t